# Product-first planning docs (kept local/private, not part of the public submission).
# Note the `docs/*` form: git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is
# itself excluded, so the exceptions below only work against the contents glob.
MASTERPLAN.md
docs/*
docs/plan/*
!docs/plan/

# ...except the security story, which is public on purpose (Phase 7).
!docs/THREAT_MODEL.md
!docs/RUNBOOKS.md
